  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig 1, 'Public health supply chain partners and processes'. Four nested circles. The outer blue circle holds forecasting and planning and traceability, with the Ministry of health, regulators, procurers, manufacturers/distributors and logistics providers on or near its rim. The orange circle holds sourcing and contract management, procurement and transportation/shipping. The purple circle holds warehouse management, order management and transportation/distribution, with central and regional warehouses on its rim. The innermost green circle holds dispensing, with community health, health facilities and individuals at the centre.",
